####################################################################
# CS:APP Buffer Lab (IA32)
#
# Handout files for students
####################################################################

This directory contains the 32-bit buffer overflow lab materials.

Official Lab Writeup: http://csapp.cs.cmu.edu/3e/buflab32.pdf

Note: This is the older 32-bit version of the buffer overflow lab.
The newer Attack Lab (target1/) is the 64-bit replacement.

Files:

bufbomb
    The buffer bomb program you will attack.

makecookie
    Generates a cookie based on your userid.

hex2raw
    Utility to generate byte sequences for exploit strings.
